Design a 4-bit binary counter that counts up on each clock cycle. The counter resets to zero when the reset signal is activated. The module maintains the current count value and updates it on the rising edge of the clock. When reset, the counter outputs zero; otherwise, it increments the count sequentially on each clock pulse.
